#
# Video toolbox — Qualcomm VPP post-processing (frame generation, AI upscale,
# picture) armed per video session.
#
# The parameters are applied by libstagefright at MediaCodec::configure(), which
# runs inside the *player's own process* — an app domain, not system_server. So the
# read grant has to reach every domain that can host a media player: a sideloaded
# player (untrusted_app), a bundled one (priv_app), and Settings/Gallery-style
# system apps.
#
# Read-only, and scoped to persist.sys.videobox.* alone (see
# private/property_contexts). Apps can already read far more sensitive properties
# under exported_system_prop; this adds six integers describing what the user chose
# in their own sidebar. Writes stay restricted to GameSpace — see
# private/gamespace_app.te.
get_prop(appdomain, videobox_prop)
